msgstr "Reduce motion"

msgid "MOTION_SYSTEM"
msgstr "Following your device setting. Reduced motion removes transitions and follows the music one measure at a time."

msgid "MOTION_OVERRIDE"
msgstr "Your choice is saved on this device. Reduced motion removes transitions and follows the music one measure at a time."

msgid "MOTION_FOLLOW"
